{"nodes": [{"id": "_agents_skills_revenue_centric_design_references_ai_era_differentiation_ai_era_differentiation___moats", "label": "AI-Era Differentiation & Moats", "file_type": "document", "source_file": ".agents/skills/revenue-centric-design/references/ai-era-differentiation.md", "source_location": "document", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "_agents_skills_revenue_centric_design_references_ai_era_differentiation_faster_building_doesn_t_fix_churn___activation_does", "label": "Faster building doesn't fix churn \u2014 activation does", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".agents/skills/revenue-centric-design/references/ai-era-differentiation.md", "source_location": "section: Faster building doesn't fix churn \u2014 activation does", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Build speed was never the bottleneck. Shipping the same confusing interface faster is just a more efficient route to churn. The real gap is the space between a user entering the product and understanding what to do."}, {"id": "_agents_skills_revenue_centric_design_references_ai_era_differentiation_same_engine__different_ux__don_t_compete_on_the_commodity", "label": "Same engine, different UX: don't compete on the commodity", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".agents/skills/revenue-centric-design/references/ai-era-differentiation.md", "source_location": "section: Same engine, different UX: don't compete on the commodity", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "AI turned your codebase into a near-commodity \u2014 under the hood ~90% of new tools call the same APIs. Engineering solves the base function; design and packaging are what differentiate and resist copying."}, {"id": "_agents_skills_revenue_centric_design_references_ai_era_differentiation_a_validated_idea_is_a_short_term_game___plan_the_moat", "label": "A validated idea is a short-term game \u2014 plan the moat", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".agents/skills/revenue-centric-design/references/ai-era-differentiation.md", "source_location": "section: A validated idea is a short-term game \u2014 plan the moat", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "If your only advantage is the codebase, you've merely built a validated MVP for better-funded competitors to execute. Structural barriers to entry (the moat) are planned, never accidental."}, {"id": "_agents_skills_revenue_centric_design_references_ai_era_differentiation_design_for_shrinking_attention_spans", "label": "Design for shrinking attention spans", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".agents/skills/revenue-centric-design/references/ai-era-differentiation.md", "source_location": "section: Design for shrinking attention spans", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Short-form video acts on the brain like a variable-reward slot machine, switching off the attention filter and eroding self-control \u2014 leaving users with high anxiety and low focus. If your user's attention keeps shrinking, design must be militarily focused."}, {"id": "_agents_skills_revenue_centric_design_references_ai_era_differentiation_sell_the_value__not_the_feature_list___and_show_the_product", "label": "Sell the value, not the feature list \u2014 and show the product", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".agents/skills/revenue-centric-design/references/ai-era-differentiation.md", "source_location": "section: Sell the value, not the feature list \u2014 and show the product", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "AI auto-generates landing pages, but ~90% share the same defects. A generic, inconsistent hero is what loses visitors, not the absence of fancy design."}, {"id": "_agents_skills_revenue_centric_design_references_ai_era_differentiation_don_t_let_ai_to_figma_to_code_factory_technical_debt", "label": "Don't let AI-to-Figma-to-code factory technical debt", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".agents/skills/revenue-centric-design/references/ai-era-differentiation.md", "source_location": "section: Don't let AI-to-Figma-to-code factory technical debt", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A Claude \u2192 Figma \u2192 Code flow looks like speed but creates two documents that drift out of sync, plus inconsistent components \u2014 a maintenance Frankenstein, not velocity."}, {"id": "_agents_skills_revenue_centric_design_references_ai_era_differentiation_beat_the_four_ai_failure_modes_that_make_a_vibe_coded_saas_feel_like_a_fraud", "label": "Beat the four AI failure modes that make a vibe-coded SaaS feel like a fraud", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".agents/skills/revenue-centric-design/references/ai-era-differentiation.md", "source_location": "section: Beat the four AI failure modes that make a vibe-coded SaaS feel like a fraud", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "When the barrier to entry tends to zero, competition tends to infinity. AI lowered that barrier and amplified Dunning-Kruger \u2014 you feel omniscient but lack the base to judge if its output is a solution or wasted time. You shipped code, not a seductive product, and you're diving into a red ocean. Code is no longer the asset \u2014 just one ingredient."}, {"id": "_agents_skills_revenue_centric_design_references_ai_era_differentiation__richardrx___2026_04_02", "label": "@richardrx \u00b7 2026-04-02", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".agents/skills/revenue-centric-design/references/ai-era-differentiation.md", "source_location": "link: @richardrx \u00b7 2026-04-02", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "reference_url": "https://x.com/richardrx/status/2039685818273378644"}, {"id": "_agents_skills_revenue_centric_design_references_ai_era_differentiation__richardrx___2026_03_03", "label": "@richardrx \u00b7 2026-03-03", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".agents/skills/revenue-centric-design/references/ai-era-differentiation.md", "source_location": "link: @richardrx \u00b7 2026-03-03", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "reference_url": "https://x.com/richardrx/status/2028837448717926518"}, {"id": "_agents_skills_revenue_centric_design_references_ai_era_differentiation__richardrx___2026_02_26", "label": "@richardrx \u00b7 2026-02-26", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".agents/skills/revenue-centric-design/references/ai-era-differentiation.md", "source_location": "link: @richardrx \u00b7 2026-02-26", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "reference_url": "https://x.com/richardrx/status/2026978144343687177"}, {"id": "_agents_skills_revenue_centric_design_references_ai_era_differentiation__richardrx___2026_02_21", "label": "@richardrx \u00b7 2026-02-21", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".agents/skills/revenue-centric-design/references/ai-era-differentiation.md", "source_location": "link: @richardrx \u00b7 2026-02-21", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "reference_url": "https://x.com/richardrx/status/2025246347587162602"}, {"id": "_agents_skills_revenue_centric_design_references_ai_era_differentiation__richardrx___2026_02_18", "label": "@richardrx \u00b7 2026-02-18", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".agents/skills/revenue-centric-design/references/ai-era-differentiation.md", "source_location": "link: @richardrx \u00b7 2026-02-18", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "reference_url": "https://x.com/richardrx/status/2024076972565963186"}, {"id": "_agents_skills_revenue_centric_design_references_ai_era_differentiation__richardrx___2026_01_19"